WEBVTT

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.786
you would see that there's a tremendous,

00:00:32.786 --> 00:00:35.767
awesome resource of leaders

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:38.523
who are leading in middle management,

00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:41.639
which raises a different question:

00:00:41.639 --> 00:00:43.889
Why are there so many women

00:00:43.889 --> 00:00:45.880
mired in the middle

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:47.702
and what has to happen

00:00:47.702 --> 00:00:50.245
to take them to the top?

00:00:50.245 --> 00:00:52.764
So some of you might be some of those women

00:00:52.764 --> 00:00:54.587
who are in middle management

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:58.513
and seeking to move up in your organization.

00:00:58.513 --> 00:01:02.135
Well, Tonya is a great example
of one of these women.